# The prototype's broom in free flight against the arrow keys: the yaw from the move stick's X at full and half tilt
# and from the Right key, the pitch from its Y and from the Up key. In Quidditch_Intro's mock game Harry flies freely
# (he follows no Snitch), so the stick turns him directly; every sample starts from one spot in the air at pitch 0.
# A yaw sample settles 30 ticks and is watched 150; a pitch sample is watched 40 ticks from the input, below the
# broom's pitch limit. The waits are on watch lines (tick counts at the default 120 fps cap):
#   tools/dev/inputtest/run.sh <run-tree> broom.scen <out-dir> Quidditch_Intro -NULLRENDERER
#   tools/dev/inputtest/rate.py <out-dir>/game.log 0
# The tags name the axis, the input and the tilt (yaw-stick-0.5: the stick's X at half tilt); the _ tags are the
# settling and resting ticks between samples. The stick at full tilt turns and pitches at the keys' rate.
waitlog Bringing Level Quidditch_Intro\.MyLevel up for play
pad attach
waitlog Entered GameMockGame State
watch 2 _attached
waitlog watch _attached 1
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
pad axis leftx 32767
watch 30 _settle-yaw-stick-1.0
waitlog watch _settle-yaw-stick-1.0 29
watch 150 yaw-stick-1.0
waitlog watch yaw-stick-1.0 149
pad axis leftx 0
watch 12 _rest-yaw-stick-1.0
waitlog watch _rest-yaw-stick-1.0 11
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
pad axis leftx 16384
watch 30 _settle-yaw-stick-0.5
waitlog watch _settle-yaw-stick-0.5 29
watch 150 yaw-stick-0.5
waitlog watch yaw-stick-0.5 149
pad axis leftx 0
watch 12 _rest-yaw-stick-0.5
waitlog watch _rest-yaw-stick-0.5 11
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
key Right 1
watch 30 _settle-yaw-key
waitlog watch _settle-yaw-key 29
watch 150 yaw-key
waitlog watch yaw-key 149
key Right 0
watch 12 _rest-yaw-key
waitlog watch _rest-yaw-key 11
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
watch 12 _pre-pitch-stick-1.0
waitlog watch _pre-pitch-stick-1.0 11
pad axis lefty -32767
watch 40 pitch-stick-1.0
waitlog watch pitch-stick-1.0 39
pad axis lefty 0
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
watch 12 _pre-pitch-stick-0.5
waitlog watch _pre-pitch-stick-0.5 11
pad axis lefty -16384
watch 40 pitch-stick-0.5
waitlog watch pitch-stick-0.5 39
pad axis lefty 0
exec TELEPORT -337 -13417 -527 3988 0
watch 12 _pre-pitch-key
waitlog watch _pre-pitch-key 11
key Up 1
watch 40 pitch-key
waitlog watch pitch-key 39
key Up 0
watch 12 _end
waitlog watch _end 11
